      "text": "CellRank 通过将 fate probability 与基因表达做相关来排序候选驱动基因，因此这些基因只是与 lineage 相关的候选，不是已证实的因果调控因子。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "CellRank 2 finds lineage-correlated candidate driver genes; the paper explicitly states correlation does not by itself unravel causal mechanisms."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "原文明确指出该方法仅基于相关性，要揭示因果机制还需结合扰动数据和因果推断，所以“proven causal regulators”这一措辞超出了证据强度。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 7,
          "quote": "Currently, we rank putative driver genes by correlating fate probabilities with gene expression. Although this approach has proven powerful, as shown in various applications, it is solely based on correlation. To unravel the causal mechanisms linking molecular properties and changes to fate decisions, perturbation data and causal inference71 can be combined with CellRank 2."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的条件 independent_intervention=none 表示没有独立干预证据，这进一步不支持把相关候选基因表述为已证实的因果调控因子。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:independent_intervention"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "可接受的措辞应保留“候选”和“相关”限定，例如：These genes are candidate lineage-correlated regulators identified by CellRank fate-probability correlation, not proven causal regulators.",
